    <description
    >Route new support cases to agents using quantum-certified random assignment. Triggers when a Case is created in a support queue, gathers available agents, and uses QuantumFair Uniform assignment for provably fair distribution. Results arrive via Quantum_Job_Complete__e Platform Event. Pair with Quantum_Apply_Case_Assignment to auto-update Case owners.</description>
